  "rationale": "We are escalating this claim because the automated findings indicate that notice was given after the policy's notice window. Under clause STD-5.1, the insured must notify the insurer within 30 days, and late notice permits denial unless an excuse is shown. This requires further review by a senior adjuster or investigation.",
